announcement-lifesign-alert-title = Lifesign Alert

announcement-lifesign-aliens-text = Unidentified lifesigns detected coming aboard { $station }. Secure any exterior access, including ducting and ventilation.

announcement-lifesign-flux-text = A large organic energy flux has been recorded near of { $station }, please stand-by.

announcement-biohazard-alert-title = Biohazard Alert

announcement-biohazard-outbreak-text = Confirmed outbreak of level 5 biohazard aboard { $station }. All personnel must contain the outbreak.

announcement-ionstorm-text = Ion storm detected near the station. Please check all AI-controlled equipment for errors.

announcement-pirates-contact-title = Incoming Message

announcement-pirates-contact-text = Incoming subspace communication. Secure channel opened at all communication consoles.

announcement-pirate-datatheft-text = Data theft signal detected; source registered on local GPS units.

announcement-fugitive-cops-title = Spacepol Command

announcement-fugitive-cops-text = Attention Crew of { $station }, this is the Police. A wanted criminal has been reported taking refuge on your station. We have a warrant from the SSC authorities to take them into custody. Officers have been dispatched to your location. We demand your cooperation in bringing this criminal to justice.

announcement-fugitive-russian-title = Russian Freighter

announcement-fugitive-russian-text = Zdraviya zhelaju, { $station } crew. We are coming to your station. There is a criminal aboard. We will arrest them and return them to the gulag. That's good, yes?

announcement-fugitive-bounty-title = Unregistered Signal

announcement-fugitive-bounty-text = { $station }. One of our bounty marks has ended up on your station. We will be arriving to collect shortly. Let's make this quick. If you don't want trouble, stay the hell out of our way.

announcement-fugitive-psyker-title = Fortune-Telling Entertainment Shuttle

announcement-fugitive-psyker-text = HEY, CAN YOU HEAR US? We're coming to your station. There's a bad guy down there, really bad guy. We need to arrest them. We're also offering fortune telling services out of the front door if you have paying customers.

announcement-fugitive-mi13-title = Nanotrasen Intrusion Countermeasures Electronics

announcement-fugitive-mi13-text = Illegal intrusion detected in the crew monitoring network. Central Command has been informed. Please report any suspicious individuals or behaviour to your local security team.

announcement-fugitive-unknown-title = Unknown Signal

announcement-fugitive-unknown-text = Unidentified ship detected near the station.

announcement-blob-critical-text = Biohazard has reached critical mass. Station loss is imminent.

announcement-blob-countermeasures-title = Emergency Biohazard Countermeasure Alert

announcement-blob-countermeasures-text = Experimental, classified, and very expensive emergency countermeasures have been activated to prevent total station loss, but the initial failure to contain the viral biohazard will be noted on the station's performance report. Expect further penalties.

announcement-cult-curse-title = System Failure

announcement-malf-runtimes-text = Hostile runtimes detected in all station systems, please deactivate your AI to prevent possible damage to its morality core.

announcement-malf-doomsday-abort-text = DOOMSDAY DEVICE OUT OF STATION RANGE, ABORTING

announcement-malf-doomsday-countdown-text = { $seconds } SECONDS UNTIL DOOMSDAY DEVICE ACTIVATION!

announcement-malf-lockdown-title = Network Alert:

announcement-malf-lockdown-text = Hostile runtime detected in door controllers. Isolation lockdown protocols are now in effect. Please remain calm.

announcement-nukebomb-command-title = Nuclear Operations Command

announcement-nukebomb-syndiebase-text = Long Range Scanners indicate that the nuclear device has detonated on a previously unknown base, we assume the base to be of Syndicate Origin. Good work crew.

announcement-nukebomb-miss-text = Long Range Scanners indicate that the nuclear device has detonated; however seismic activity on the station is minimal. We anticipate that the device has not detonated on the station itself.

announcement-nukeop-war-title = Declaration of War

announcement-nukeop-war-sender = Nuclear Operative Outpost

announcement-revolution-quelled-text = It appears the mutiny has been quelled. Please return yourself and your incapacitated colleagues to work. We have remotely blacklisted the head revolutionaries in your medical records to prevent accidental revival.

announcement-revolution-loyalty-sender = { $sender } Loyalty Monitoring Division

announcement-separatist-secession-title = Secession from { $station }

announcement-separatist-formed-text = The new independent state of { $nation } has formed from the ashes of the { $department } department!

announcement-separatist-assistants-text = The assistants of the station have risen to form the new independent state of { $nation }!

announcement-wildlife-observations-title = { $sender } Wildlife Observations

announcement-dragon-carp-text = A large amount of lifeforms have been detected approaching { $station } at extreme speeds. Remaining crew are advised to evacuate as soon as possible.

announcement-carp-rift-charged-text = Spatial object has reached peak energy charge in { $area }, please stand-by.

announcement-carp-rift-halfway-text = A rift is causing an unnaturally large energy flux in { $area }. Stop it at all costs!

announcement-meteor-alert-title = Meteor Alert

announcement-wizard-meteors-text = Meteors have been detected on collision course with the station.

announcement-higher-dimensional-title = { $sender } Higher Dimensional Affairs

announcement-wizard-cheese-text = Danger: Extremely potent reality altering object has been summoned on station. Immediate evacuation advised. Brace for impact.

announcement-wizard-ritual-major-text = Major anomalous fluctuations to local spacetime detected in: { $area }.

announcement-wizard-ritual-unusual-text = Unusual anomalous energy fluctuations detected in: { $area }.

announcement-wizard-ritual-spike-text = Large anomalous energy spike detected in: { $area }.

announcement-wizard-ritual-failed-text = Automatic causality stabilisation failed, recommend urgent intervention in: { $area }.

announcement-wizard-ritual-imminent-text = Imminent local reality failure in: { $area }. All crew please prepare to evacuate.

announcement-narsie-gone-text = Status report? We detected an anomaly, but it disappeared almost immediately.

announcement-narsie-detected-text = An acausal dimensional event has been detected in your sector. Event has been flagged EXTINCTION-CLASS. Directing all available assets toward simulating solutions. SOLUTION ETA: 60 SECONDS.

announcement-narsie-aborted-text = Simulations aborted, sensors report that the acasual event is normalizing. Good work, crew.

announcement-narsie-deploying-text = Simulations on acausal dimensional event complete. Deploying solution package now. Deployment ETA: ONE MINUTE.

announcement-narsie-normalized-text = Normalization detected! Abort the solution package!
